  "title": "National Hydrology Dataset Plus High Resolution (NHDPlus HR)",
  "description": "NHDPlus HR is a national geospatial dataset depicting water flow across US landscapes and through the stream network. It integrates 1:24,000-scale National Hydrography Dataset High Resolution data, 10-meter 3D Elevation Program data, and the nationally complete Watershed Boundary Dataset. Coverage spans the United States and territories, providing hydrological features including streams, waterbodies, and drainage basins in File Geodatabase format.",
